  "limitations": [
    "One matrix installation and three controller process cuts; no ordinary full-install startup, power-loss or native transaction-crash claim.",
    "Case labels retain their historical v2/v3/v4 names; the selected image and installed policy are v5 throughout.",
    "Resume can authorize callbacks before the controller confirms its post-crash hold. These captured cases record zero new occurrence keys in that interval; that is not a universal no-callback guarantee. Confirmed pause does not drain in-flight work.",
    "Five private operator/application values are independently checked against the final receipt and runtime log; the live driver separately scans the builder credential, seven decoded artifacts/statuses and ordinary errors. The unused fleet has signed bootstrap identities without active memberships.",
    "The canonical suite began before the qualification-only release marker was corrected. Registered tests and product runtime sources were unchanged by that correction; the pinned-image preflight and this native matrix separately exercise the corrected marker.",
    "Prepared local dependencies and ordinary scoped builds; no network-isolated build, separate physical-machine, per-worker CPU quota or exactly-once external-effects claim.",
    "In-flight compatible replacement, unreachable-member pause and offline-build evidence remain to be resolved before final v5 admission."
